          "filename": "New Brighton lighthouse (50593355173).jpg",
          "caption": "This lighthouse is one of the most photographed icons on the Wirral. I just thought it would be nice to see it when all is calm. The port of Liverpool is the back-drop.\nKit used: Nikon D 7100 &amp; Zoom-Nikkor 100~300mm 1:5.6\n\n\nref: 3676 - 12th Nov 2020",
